   "stem": {
      "text": "The nth partial sum of the series \\( \\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} a_n \\) is \\( S_n = \\frac{n - 3}{n + 4} \\) for \\( n \\ge 1 \\). The series converges. Find its sum.",
